 Extends v2 with the complete HIC pipeline: - Dual-spin Merkabah (forward + backward HIC-enriched passes) - Kabala phase (22 HIC-addressed dependent reads) - Brahma-jyoti finalization (22 rounds of SHA3-512 + HIC)  This is the Phase X+ algorithm, activated by `CHV42_DUAL_SPIN_FORK_HEIGHT`.  Pipeline: ```text Blake3 XOF init(seed → 256 KiB) → AES cascade 4 passes(256 KiB) → Merkabah Dual-Spin (forward + backward HIC passes) → Keccak-256 × 256 random reads → Kabala 22 HIC reads → Brahma-jyoti SHA3-512 finalize → Hash64 ```

